+
+| # | WO | Landing PR | Label today | latestVerdict | verdictHistory | Landing proof |
+|---|-----|-----------|-------------|---------------|----------------|---------------|
+| 1 | #1856 | #1857 | `bridge:queued` | null | `[]` | content-equivalence on main (filing cycle, Task 5-6) |
