+| 4 | #2221 | #2222 | `bridge:queued` | null | `[]` | **byte-exact** vs patched copy (Task 12-13) |
+| 5 | #2238 | #2239 | `bridge:queued` | null | `[]` | **byte-exact**, re-verified today: doc 9188caa / checker afe6e96 both sha-stable on main |
+| 6 | #2252 | #2253 | `bridge:landed` | null | `[]` | **byte-exact** c6a3f81 (8,496B raw), re-verified twice today |
